  {
    "screen": "wechatdirect-05",
    "orientation": "h",
    "source_image": "E:\\Cache\\Claude\\Temp\\4bd59299\\b1\\wechatdirect\\img\\wechatdirect-05-h.png",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "chapter_title",
        "text_ref": "档案怎么存、怎么更新",
        "align": "center",
        "size": "large"
      },
      {
        "type": "document_mock",
        "text_ref": "文件夹里有：",
        "row": "archive",
        "width": "40%",
        "align": "left",
        "variant": "directory",
        "columns": 1,
        "header_nodes": 1,
        "directory_art": "none",
        "file_icons": [
          "_library/fix-round-2/icon-clean-45940475938ca8fdb78a.png",
          "_library/fix-round-2/icon-clean-45940475938ca8fdb78a.png",
          "_library/fix-round-2/icon-clean-45940475938ca8fdb78a.png",
          "_library/fix-round-2/icon-clean-45940475938ca8fdb78a.png",
          "_library/fix-round-2/icon-clean-45940475938ca8fdb78a.png",
          "_library/fix-round-2/icon-clean-45940475938ca8fdb78a.png",
          "_library/icons/文件夹.png"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "source_text_card",
        "text_ref": "再跑一次：先核对已有文件的指纹都对得上。微信库没变，只看一眼元数据就结束；有新消息就从上次的位置接着读，多个分库时往回重叠1天防漏，去掉重复",
        "columns": 1,
        "columns_v": 1,
        "row": "archive",
        "width": "60%",
        "whole_block": true
      },
      {
        "type": "source_text_card",
        "text_ref": "换新版本：在旁边的临时文件夹里建好、核对完才换上。换的时候要改两次目录名，万一正好卡在中间断电，旧版本还在，恢复命令能撤回或完成。",
        "columns": 1,
        "columns_v": 1,
        "row": "archive",
        "whole_block": true
      },
      {
        "type": "source_text_card",
        "text_ref": "给AI的只挑一小段：平时只给ai-context.md；更早的事先在整份档案里搜到，再读附近几条。",
        "columns": 1,
        "columns_v": 1,
        "row": "archive",
        "whole_block": true
      },
      {
        "type": "notice",
        "text_ref": "实测（8月25日，一个6145条的群）：第一次建档8.2秒；再跑一次、没有新消息0.7秒；给AI的7264字节，整份记录4.49MB。"
